## Application source

The Python service, database schema/queries, browser interface, CSS illustrations, documentation and test utilities in this project are original project work and are offered under `LICENSE` (MIT). The project does not bundle third-party application code, templates, icons, photographs, or font files. The browser uses locally installed Trebuchet MS/Segoe UI with a generic sans-serif fallback.

No source code from researched products was copied, translated, modified or redistributed. Generic product patterns (resource search, booking, staff decisions, quotas, check-in/out, and histories) were implemented independently. The Snipe-IT repository was checked for licensing only; its AGPL-3.0 source is not reused.

AI-assisted development and design: significant coding, research synthesis and visual-design assistance was provided by SuperApp. The running application does not call an AI model or AI provider. In Vercel mode it connects to the operator's managed PostgreSQL database; no other third-party APIs are called at runtime.

